    <p style="font-size:0.82rem; color:#9ca3af; margin-top:-16px;">All figures at 11am MPT. Jan 4 had low wind but low price — demand context and time-of-day factors also influence outcomes. Jan 5 and Jan 6 illustrate the wind-price relationship most directly.</p>
